      "id": "claim_8e2dfb1a7c744b798e74c643e8ffac49",
      "statement": "The CLI parses arguments by hand to choose one Action (Run, Diagnose, Deploy, Dev, Cell, D1, Kv, Queue, Connect, Credentials, Token, Disconnect, Help, Version) and refuses anything ambiguous rather than guessing.",
