    {
      "id": "claim_21ffd21fd3f24afa895b4e85501d8061",
      "statement": "Node configuration overlays flags (--bucket, --endpoint, --region, --listen, --internal-listen, --advertise) onto environment values; the worker listen defaults to AutoLoopback, the internal listener to LoopbackEphemeral, and CELLD_STORAGE_PROBE defaults true because a store that ignores preconditions would make the node self-fence in a loop.",
